// SendTextRequest asks the plugin to deliver text to a pane.
//
// HAZARD: the text arrives exactly as if a human had typed it. Whatever the
// pane is currently displaying will consume it — including a confirmation
// prompt a human is in the middle of answering. Delivery into a pane a person
// is using can therefore answer a question on their behalf.
