	// reports as focused (see Pane.focused). Plugins SHALL refuse a focused pane
	// with FAILED_PRECONDITION unless this is set. The check is inherently racy
	// — a human can focus the pane immediately after it passes — so it is a
	// guard against the common accident, not a guarantee. A caller that sets
	// this owns the consequences.
